{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\uc0c1\uc138\ud398\uc774\uc9c0_\uc601\uc5b4_.jpg?t=1741196972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;The child suddenly disappeared.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a mother who lost her child begins tracking their whereabouts. During her desperate search, she hears rumors of a malevolent spirit (a revenant) that only takes children and is said to dwell in the ruins deep within the forest. Clutching at straws, she follows every lead until she finally arrives at the forsaken place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearing her son's voice, she ventures deeper and deeper into the ruins, only to find herself trapped in an endless corridor with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is only one way for her to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings carefully and experience them firsthand to detect any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you discover an anomaly, proceed to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> If not, head toward a different exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You never know how they might try to deceive you. Stay vigilant at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the objects placed on each floor to uncover hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you search carefully, you may discover even more stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ubd80\uc801_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1741196972\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Observe and immerse yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mere observation won\u2019t be enough to escape this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the objects carefully and pay close attention to even the slightest changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ub215\uae30_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1741196972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Input</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movements : W, A, S, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk : L Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight : F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact : LMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">De-Interact : RMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotation Reset : WMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2230420?t=1741196972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/6a9ec8c1e7671107f12d6d2b29b78d7e3f83d4ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741196972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/46d1a990563afd9e57962f294fd922189e7d6f7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741196972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/46d1a990563afd9e57962f294fd922189e7d6f7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741196972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\uc0c1\uc138\ud398\uc774\uc9c0_\uc601\uc5b4_.jpg?t=1741196972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;The child suddenly disappeared.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a mother who lost her child begins tracking their whereabouts. During her desperate search, she hears rumors of a malevolent spirit (a revenant) that only takes children and is said to dwell in the ruins deep within the forest. Clutching at straws, she follows every lead until she finally arrives at the forsaken place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearing her son's voice, she ventures deeper and deeper into the ruins, only to find herself trapped in an endless corridor with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is only one way for her to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings carefully and experience them firsthand to detect any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you discover an anomaly, proceed to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> If not, head toward a different exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You never know how they might try to deceive you. Stay vigilant at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the objects placed on each floor to uncover hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you search carefully, you may discover even more stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ubd80\uc801_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1741196972\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Observe and immerse yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mere observation won\u2019t be enough to escape this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the objects carefully and pay close attention to even the slightest changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ub215\uae30_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1741196972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Input</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movements : W, A, S, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk : L Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight : F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact : LMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">De-Interact : RMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ro